CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

The audio files under `assets/audio/sfx/` in this directory are
synthetic sound effects generated entirely from mathematical
oscillators and noise (ffmpeg lavfi `sine` / `aevalsrc`). They are
contributed to the public domain under CC0 1.0 by the montage
project authors.

You may use, copy, modify, and distribute these files, including
for commercial purposes, without permission or attribution.

